        description: "Objects marked DontDestroyOnLoad persist across every scene load, along with everything they reference." + (unguarded.length > 0 ? ` ${unguarded.length} of these calls have no visible duplicate-instance guard nearby, so a new persistent object may be created each time the scene containing them is loaded.` : " Each call appears to sit near a duplicate-instance guard, which is the correct pattern."),
