        `| **Frame rate** | **${f.medianFps} fps** median \xB7 **${f.averageFps} fps** average` + (f.stabilityPercent != null ? ` \xB7 ${f.stabilityPercent}% stable` : "") + (f.displayHz ? ` (screen refreshes at ${f.displayHz} Hz)` : "") + " |"
