  out.push("## Memory retained per screen");
  out.push("");
  out.push(
    "Retention is what did **not** come back after leaving a screen. It is the most reliable figure here because it is a closed loop \u2014 enter, peak, leave \u2014 so it does not depend on what the tester did before or after. Retention going up is a regression."
  );
